# Maskfish is derived from Pikafish, which is derived from Stockfish, and
# contains code ported from AB-JChess (the reveal heuristics, the copy of the
# Ranger21 optimizer of the trainer, the extraction of the score <-> mass
# tables) and from jqe (the chance node options ChanceMaxLayers,
# ChanceExpandMain, ChanceMix, ChanceCV, ChanceQsearchRep, ChanceMixTT and
# ChanceMixFut). The authors of those projects below keep their copyright on
